; ============================================================
;  THE BIG WEAPON CASE.
;
;  Five cells by two in your bag - the largest footprint of any box
;  here - and eight by four inside, which is two rifles laid one above
;  the other with room left over. Like the armour case: nothing stacks
;  in it, and room is the only limit.
;
;  ITS ICON IS THE ONE THING ON THAT SHEET THAT DOES NOT FIT A SLOT.
;  Five cells is 500 px of texture and the sheet's pitch is 350, so it
;  runs into the slot to its right and that slot is reserved for it.
;  See art/mkboxdds.py, where the collision check counts rectangles
;  rather than slots for exactly this.
; ============================================================
[ampbox_weapon_big]:af_base
